row.cell:
Meeting of the United States and British Chiefs of Staff, 4 p.m. 

                            United States Minutes

 Situation in the ABDA area;
                            shipping; establishment of United States forces in Northern Ireland;
                            defense of island bases between Hawaii and Australia; inclusion of Port
                            Darwin in the ABDA area.

Meeting of the Combined Chiefs of Staff, 2:30 p.m. 

                            Combined Chiefs of Staff Minutes

 Conduct of the war in the Pacific theater in 1943; press
                            communiqué for the conference; continental operations in 1943;
                            organization of command and training for cross-Channel operations;
                            landing craft; system of command for combined operations.
